// Recorded with `cargo run -p chest -- --record examples/showcase/recordings/chest.rec.ron \
//     --paint --shot /tmp/rec.png` at 1600x900, scale factor 1.
//
// What it holds: the pointer parks over the fullest chest slot, left-clicks to
// pick the stack up, then holds the right button down and drags across three
// empty slots -- the sweep that paints one item into each. It ends mid-gesture
// with the button still down, so a replay to the last frame lands on three
// phantom previews and a cursor that has already counted itself down, which is
// a state worth scrubbing to and one no single click could produce.
//
// One frame of stray gamepad axis noise from the recording machine's joystick
// was removed by hand, so the file replays the same on a desktop with a
// controller plugged in and on one without.
(
    version: 1,
    resolution: (1600.0, 900.0),
    scale_factor: 1.0,
    frame_delta_us: 16666,
    frames: [
        (
            frame: 2,
            inputs: [
                PointerMove(
                    pos: (1003.0, 763.0),
                ),
                PointerMove(
                    pos: (1003.0, 763.0),
                ),
            ],
        ),
        (
            frame: 32,
            inputs: [
                PointerMove(
                    pos: (537.0, 306.0),
                ),
            ],
        ),
